[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4576579045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119870#issuecomment-4576579045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119870","id":4576579045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEMkN5Q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T14:58:03Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T14:58:03Z","body":"I'd say all of this is expected and documented, code doesn't run without `@tool`, see the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.html#important-information)\n\nI don't see anything in this report that isn't covered by that","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4576579045/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4576866159","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119870#issuecomment-4576866159","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119870","id":4576866159,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEM1vbw","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T15:20:45Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T15:20:45Z","body":"The only thing not mentioned in the [`@tool` documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.html#important-information) is that `@export`ed properties apparently _are_ accessible. This makes sense because they're also available for modification in the inspector, so they have to be available somehow.\n\nWould this be worth adding to the documentation? Or is it an implementation detail that should not be relied upon?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4576866159/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performe