pt uses must *also* be a tool.\n\nThe thing is, many people uses other people's tools, so they're not necessarily aware of that.\n\nHere, I'm setting properties, so I was expecting the code to work. I'm not calling methods. So, I think the error is imprecise.\n\nMaybe the error could be improved 🤷‍♂️","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4576963155/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4576982553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119870#issuecomment-4576982553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119870","id":4576982553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEM82GQ","user":{"login":"solodeveloping","id":155950383,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUudLw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155950383?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping","html_url":"https://github.com/solodeveloping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T15:30:09Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T15:30:09Z","body":"> which means you cannot call methods or **reference member variables** from them otherwise.\n\nThat's a shame, I remembered about the methods, I was not expecting this for variables","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4576982553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4577064541","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119870#issuecomment-4577064541","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119870","id":4577064541,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABENB2XQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T15:37:49Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T15:37:49Z","body":"I don't see that this confusion is justified based on the details of the documentation, the fact that it says that `_init` will be called assumes you're using it correctly\n\nThe documentation doesn't contradict itself, it doesn't specify an unrelated detail\n\nClosing as there's no bug here and the details are documented sufficiently, we can't document *everywhere* that you need to have `@tool` if you're using a `@tool` as that's given","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4577064541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]